<title>USA: Allmerica Financial to buy rest of insurer.</title>
<headline>Allmerica Financial to buy rest of insurer.</headline>
<dateline>WORCESTER, Mass. 1997-02-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Allmerica Financial Corp on Wednesday said it signed a definitive agreement to acquire Allmerica Property &amp; Casualty Cos Inc for about $800 million.</p>
<p>Under the deal, Allmerica Financial would acquire the 40.5 percent of Allmerica Property that it did not already own, or 24.2 million shares, for $33 each.</p>
<p>The deal is expected to close in the third quarter of 1997.</p>
</text>
